chiori add stats def%=0.062*3 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*2 er=0.0551*3 em=19.82*2 cr=0.0331*10 cd=0.0662*12;

